    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1686931178\" /></span><br><br>ANYU is a 3D third-person narrative exploration game, set in a frozen wasteland where an ancient civilization fell. Centered around movement puzzles and dealing with environment mechanics.<br><br>Ikku will face an arctic world and must reach the top of the mountain to finally get a glimpse of the northern lights. During the journey, he will encounter some helpful friends and the remnants of an ancient civilization. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1686931178\" /></span><br>Explore the frozen wasteland with your skis:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/bd7772a1e49a256c6c761db2bea13068.poster.avif?t=1686931178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/bd7772a1e49a256c6c761db2bea13068.webm?t=1686931178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/bd7772a1e49a256c6c761db2bea13068.mp4?t=1686931178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Interact with the world to progress:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/d9aff82d0494e41e5e3a34eb4e487025.poster.avif?t=1686931178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431310/extras/d9aff82d0494e41e5e3a34eb4e487025.webm?t=1686931178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared